    "environment_dependent_core_halo_relation": "Dwarf galaxies (low baryon density, tau_decoh > 500 Gyr) preserve the pure Schive et al. r_c ~ M_c^-1 relation, whereas baryon-rich spirals show systematically puffed-up cores. This creates a distinct falsifiable observational test."
